    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "# Chapter 1: The Echoes of Old\nThe ship drifted through the nebula. Kael looked out of the viewport.\nHe missed the green plains of his home, Terren.\nThe mission was simple: retrieve the Stellar Core.",
      "hash": "sha256:60066aae6893a29c643b833b6c63db90dfc4e6429407227febe02bd5a2685370",
      "line_start": 9,
      "line_end": 12
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "# Chapter 2: The Bargain\nAt the space station, Zora waited. She was a known smuggler.\n\"I have the coordinates,\" she whispered, handing Kael a drive.\n\"The price remains the same: a seat on the next transport.\"",
      "hash": "sha256:4f85bc3a5390301f36e8a24d5953324013312237bb08e6a9f551936f9657c3af",
      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 17
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "# Chapter 3: The Betrayal\nKael realized too late that the drive was a tracker.\nZora had sold them out to the Syndicate.\nThe alarm began to blare throughout the ship.",
      "hash": "sha256:f16611391f5719f6503f20c04f3369c4c77dc794e0965e663cfb46048e9a1479",
      "line_start": 19,
      "line_end": 22
    }
